WEBVTT

00:07:59.664 --> 00:08:03.089
it started to become
a little more consumer centric

00:08:03.113 --> 00:08:05.808
and tried to speak to a broader audience,

00:08:05.832 --> 00:08:07.952
and then you saw
the evolution of the company

00:08:07.976 --> 00:08:09.188
trying to do more things.

00:08:09.212 --> 00:08:10.418
We live, we grow,

00:08:10.442 --> 00:08:12.672
and then it goes really
about serving everybody

00:08:12.696 --> 00:08:15.666
and enabling everyone

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:18.163
to, you know, live their best lives.

00:08:18.945 --> 00:08:20.342
It became incredibly broad,

00:08:20.366 --> 00:08:25.135
but I think a lot of people
suited up every day to go do that,

00:08:25.159 --> 00:08:27.374
I think people jumped out of bed excited

00:08:27.398 --> 00:08:29.105
to try to help people.

00:08:29.129 --> 00:08:30.629
It was a powerful mission.